| source = —Harris talking about the success of "We Found Love"<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.mtv.co.uk/news/rihanna/367365-rihanna-calvin-harris-we-found-love-career-change|title=Scottish DJ says his own music charted higher after We Found Love...|publisher=[[MTV UK]]. [[Viacom (2005–present)|Viacom]]|date=2012-10-26|access-date=2012-10-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130206111753/http://www.mtv.co.uk/news/rihanna/367365-rihanna-calvin-harris-we-found-love-career-change|archive-date=2013-02-06|url-status=dead}}</ref>
