://www.hollywoodreporter.com/earshot/leona-lewis-we-found-love-rihanna-379119 |access-date=14 January 2021 |work=15 October 2012 |date=14 January 2021}}</ref> In 2013, [[Nicole Scherzinger]] claimed that she was the first artist given the song but ended up rejecting it, commenting. "I've got the demo of that song and I was busy at the time. They'd sent me a few dance tracks and I wasn't able to get to them and I was like, 'Oh there's so much dance and I want to take a break from it."<ref>{{cite web|last=Corner|first=Lewis|title=Nicole Scherzinger turned down Rihanna's 'We Found Love'|url=http://www.digitalspy.com/music/news/a460631/nicole-scherzinger-turned-down-rihannas-we-found-love.html|work=Digital Spy|access-date=2013-02-22|date=2013-02-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150113093116/http://www.digitalspy.com/music/news/a460631/nicole-scherzinger-turned-down-rihannas-we-found-love.html|archive-date=2015-01-13|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last=Viera|first=Bené|title=www.vh1.com/music/tuner/2013-02-22/nicole-scherzinger-should-have-never-ever-admitted-to-passing-on-we-found-love/|url=http://www.vh1.com/music/tuner/2013-02-22/nicole-scherzinger-should-have-never-ever-admitted-to-passing-on-we-found-love/|publisher=VH1|access-date=2013-02-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150608140435/http://www.vh1.com/music/tuner/2013-02-22/nicole-scherzinger-should-have-never-ever-admitted-to-passing-on-we-found-love/|archive-date=2015-06-08|url-status=dead}}</ref>

